{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787030375984554001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"dimming-grandiose-swift","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"de1970c222c33237c52562f0699cd2d8d71cd94953c11a9508c5705e636db53c","event_uuid":"d2febd39-3e7b-498a-add8-524670561562","position":{"commit_sha":"74cccd5b07a54180f87fb2ac0502bda830168703","position":"1787028338153268001-d2febd39-3e7b-498a-add8-524670561562"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"62dafee5cb5e8037a9e6ba978823e733a25e4ecc70eb71717c359c63468d5847","event_uuid":"31919aed-ad2c-4b5f-a5cd-194451132003","position":{"commit_sha":"89deac370930e0d00213b654f34feec7b41f24a8","position":"1787028351390708001-31919aed-ad2c-4b5f-a5cd-194451132003"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"3a87906c2dbeda27bcbdbb98f27d2ca70793a671cdbdcc9070ff22908d3b8849","event_uuid":"663edc56-f23c-4551-a69e-5165a1045837","position":{"commit_sha":"ce568f67fe20ad074bcda5fee35c1041f2e41ce1","position":"1787028356953836001-663edc56-f23c-4551-a69e-5165a1045837"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6c90fc10630cb7158178d242f8d1a4121b856b103f5fc4872a4542d786151d74","event_uuid":"b6ade6db-b403-4530-a6b7-8a2102d5e82b","position":{"commit_sha":"baf3e85690331d16b5ce579b92e3f23a81b1eacd","position":"1787028363732903001-b6ade6db-b403-4530-a6b7-8a2102d5e82b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787028338153268001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"b6ade6db-b403-4530-a6b7-8a2102d5e82b","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"d04c-c184-0b00-4a8a"}],"description":"## Context\nOnce Jira returns a key, local persistence can still fail. The canonical label is the durable remote identity floor; the entity property is optional enrichment. Local confirmation must use RP-02 as the single identity owner.\n\n## Outcome\nAfter create returns a key, attach `rebar-id:<local_id>` first, attempt the optional property second, then persist known key and confirmation through the RP-02 facade. Any failure returns a typed known-key safety abort without remote deletion.\n\n## Plan\n1. Require RP-02 repository/lifecycle/recovery facade to be available; do not create a second binding writer.\n2. Apply the canonical label before any property or local confirmation. Treat property unsupported/permission failure as visible enrichment failure that cannot erase the label floor.\n3. Persist known key and confirmation through named `BindingStore` operations and their unit of work.\n4. If label or persistence fails, preserve key, pending/recovery evidence, remote issue, and exact terminal disposition.\n5. Execute later lifecycle intents only after their remote postcondition is proven.\n\n## Testing\nFault cuts after returned key, during label, property, known-key save, and confirmation assert remote containment, local bytes, and outcomes.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The canonical label is attempted before optional property and local confirmation.\n- [ ] Unsupported or forbidden property remains visible and cannot remove a successful label.\n- [ ] Known key and confirmation persist only through the RP-02 `BindingStore` facade.\n- [ ] Every post-create failure reports the known key and retains recovery evidence.\n- [ ] No post-create failure deletes the remote issue.\n- [ ] Other lifecycle intents execute only after their remote postconditions are proven.\n\n## Out of scope\nWhole-pass crash/restart convergence, dependency release, and production create cutover.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/coordinator.py","reason":"Coordinate label-first containment and local confirmation."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_one.py","reason":"Execute label, optional property, and known-key steps."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_handlers.py","reason":"Execute lifecycle intents through the BindingStore facade."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py","reason":"Label/property/persistence fault-cut tests."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_identity_write_retention_heldout.py","reason":"Known-key retention and no-delete regression coverage."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","d04c-c184-0b00-4a8a"],["parent","59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp03","create","binding-store","tdd"],"ticket_id":"1cb3-d60c-0d32-4cfe","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S4 T2 — Contain returned creates and confirm through BindingStore","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_identity_write_retention_heldout.py -k \"label or property or persistence or known_key or lifecycle\"","dd_id":"AC1-AC6","dd_text":"Label-first order, property semantics, BindingStore confirmation, key evidence, no delete, and lifecycle ordering"}]},"source_event_uuids":["d2febd39-3e7b-498a-add8-524670561562","31919aed-ad2c-4b5f-a5cd-194451132003","663edc56-f23c-4551-a69e-5165a1045837","b6ade6db-b403-4530-a6b7-8a2102d5e82b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787030375984554001,"uuid":"d2fa22cd-3fc7-4e67-967a-236d8bbc70f5"}